# --- run-output trees (regenerable via README / paper-repro commands) ---
# *.pkl / *.pt / checkpoints/ above already exclude the bulk (hundreds of GB of
# raw activity/weights). These add the per-run diagnostic PNGs each training
# script dumps automatically -- NOT the assembled paper figures, which live
# under code_analysis/**/figures and paper/paper_figures and stay tracked.
Repro/**/*.png
New_Results/**/*.png
New_Results_v2/**/*.png
New_Results_v3/**/*.png
old_code/**/*.png
Results/**/*.png

# Legacy/superseded run trees kept on disk for provenance only -- do not
# track (New_Results_v3/ and Repro/ are current/canonical and NOT listed
# here; their heavy files are already excluded above by extension).
/New_Results/
/New_Results_v2/
/Results/
/old_code/

# external_data/: keep our own cache/figures + small scripts, drop the raw
# NWB recordings and the vendored third-party analysis repos (each has its
# own nested .git and its own license/versioning).
external_data/sosa2025/nwb/
external_data/*/code_krishnan/
external_data/sosa2025/code_sosa/

# paper/ is a separately Overleaf-synced git repo (its own remote/history,
# see README) -- not tracked inside this repo.
/paper/